	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You are well known for having a particular auditory cue. Often a whistled leitmotif or short musical phrase. You may always choose to use Performance to roll initiative. If you have a visibly holstered, or readied, light firearm when you use Performance to roll initiative, creatures within the normal range of the light firearm must make a Wisdom save against your combat maneuver defense or become rattled for a number of turns equal to your Prestige rating.</p>",
